# FortiTLDR sources. One URL per line; lines starting with # are ignored.
# A newly added URL is silently baselined on its first run (no email flood).
# Full list of FortiGuard feeds: https://www.fortiguard.com/rss-feeds

# ---- Security ----
# PSIRT security advisories (FG-IR-xx-xxx): vulnerabilities in Fortinet products
https://filestore.fortinet.com/fortiguard/rss/ir.xml

# Outbreak Alerts: actively exploited threats and the Fortinet coverage for them
https://filestore.fortinet.com/fortiguard/rss/outbreakalert.xml

# Threat Signal reports: emerging threats and recommended actions
https://filestore.fortinet.com/fortiguard/rss/threatsignal.xml

# ---- Releases and support ----
# Firmware releases: new builds for FortiOS, FortiManager, FortiAnalyzer, etc.
https://support.fortinet.com/rss/firmware.xml

# Customer Support Bulletins (CSB-xxxxxx-x): known issues, delays, required actions
https://pub.kb.fortinet.com/rss/csb.xml

# ---- Product lifecycle: End of Order / End of Support milestones ----
# Hardware (appliances, accessories, transceivers)
https://support.fortinet.com/rss/Hardware.xml
# Software (FortiOS and other product versions)
https://support.fortinet.com/rss/Software.xml
# Services (subscriptions and support SKUs)
https://support.fortinet.com/rss/Services.xml

# ---- FortiGuard signature updates (several a week) ----
# Application Control database
https://filestore.fortinet.com/fortiguard/rss/appcontrol.xml
# Operational Technology (OT) IPS signatures
https://filestore.fortinet.com/fortiguard/rss/otips.xml
# Operational Technology (OT) Application Control signatures
https://filestore.fortinet.com/fortiguard/rss/otapp.xml

